OL,3,ACamilla admits it was 'difficult' to
OL,4,Akeep King's cancer diagnosis a secret
OL,5,
OL,6,FQueen Camilla has spoken for the first
OL,7,Ftime about King Charles III's cancer
OL,8,Fdiagnosis, describing the pressure of
OL,9,Fkeeping it secret in the early stages
OL,10,Fof treatment.
OL,12,FIn a video to mark the 30th anniversary
OL,13,Fof Maggie's cancer charity, the Queen,
OL,14,Fwho is president of the charity,
OL,15,Frecalls how "difficult" it was to avoid
OL,16,Fdiscussing her husband's treatment
OL,17,Fwhile on an official engagement with
OL,18,Fcancer patients and their families.
OL,20,FIn January 2024, the Queen opened a new
OL,21,FMaggie's cancer support centre at the
OL,22,FRoyal Free Hospital in London.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
