OL,3,ASouth Korea shortens war games with US,
OL,4,Aciting Washington request
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Korean Foreign Minister Cho Hyun
OL,7,Ftold a parliamentary hearing that
OL,8,Fneither South Korean nor US officials
OL,9,Fhad been aware in advance about Trump's
OL,10,Fplans.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
